<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <%- include('../partials/head', { title: 'Help — Scriptorium' }) %>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/navbar.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/pages.css">
</head>
<body class="page-body">

  <div class="grain" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="page-orb page-orb-1" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="page-orb page-orb-2" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <%- include('../partials/navbar_app') %>

  <main class="page-main page-main--wide">
    <div class="help-layout">

      <!-- Sidebar -->
      <aside class="help-sidebar" aria-label="Help navigation">
        <p class="help-sidebar-title">In this guide</p>
        <nav class="help-nav">
          <a href="#room"         class="help-nav-link"><span class="help-nav-icon">🏠</span> Your Room</a>
          <a href="#inside-rooms" class="help-nav-link"><span class="help-nav-icon">🗂️</span> Inside Rooms</a>
          <a href="#search"       class="help-nav-link"><span class="help-nav-icon">🔍</span> Search & Save</a>
          <a href="#ai"           class="help-nav-link"><span class="help-nav-icon">✨</span> AI Picks</a>
          <a href="#reflections"  class="help-nav-link"><span class="help-nav-icon">✍️</span> Reflections</a>
          <a href="#goals"        class="help-nav-link"><span class="help-nav-icon">🎯</span> Goals</a>
          <a href="#streaks"      class="help-nav-link"><span class="help-nav-icon">🔥</span> Streaks</a>
          <a href="#yarns"        class="help-nav-link"><span class="help-nav-icon">🧶</span> Yarns</a>
          <a href="#customise"    class="help-nav-link"><span class="help-nav-icon">🐧</span> Customise</a>
        </nav>
      </aside>

      <!-- Main content -->
      <div class="help-content">

        <a href="/room" class="btn-back">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M19 12H5M12 5l-7 7 7 7"/>
          </svg>
          Back to Room
        </a>

        <div class="help-page-header">
          <div class="page-eyebrow">Help & Guide</div>
          <h1 class="page-h1">How <span class="caveat">Scriptorium</span> works</h1>
          <p class="page-sub">
            Scriptorium is your personal space for the media that matters to you — books, films, and music.
            Not a streaming platform. Save what you discover, reflect on what you've experienced,
            and track how it connects to your growth.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="help-section" id="room">
          <div class="help-section-header">
            <div class="help-section-icon">🏠</div>
            <h2 class="help-section-title">Your Room</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="help-body">
            <p>When you log in, you land in your <strong>3D room</strong>. This is your home base. Hold the left mouse button and drag to look around, and scroll to zoom in and out.</p>
            <p>The room has three clickable spots — hover over them to see them glow, then single-click to enter:</p>
          </div>
          <ul class="room-spots">
            <li class="room-spot"><span class="room-spot-icon">📚</span> The <strong>bookshelf</strong><span class="room-spot-arrow">→ Library</span></li>
            <li class="room-spot"><span class="room-spot-icon">🎵</span> The <strong>speakers</strong><span class="room-spot-arrow">→ Music Room</span></li>
            <li class="room-spot"><span class="room-spot-icon">🎬</span> The <strong>screen</strong><span class="room-spot-arrow">→ Theatre</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="help-section" id="inside-rooms">
          <div class="help-section-header">
            <div class="help-section-icon">🗂️</div>
            <h2 class="help-section-title">Inside each room</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="help-body">
            <p>Once you're in a room, you'll see your <strong>shelves</strong> — items organised by status: <span class="hl">Wishlist</span>, <span class="hl">Reading / Watching / Listening</span>, <span class="hl">Finished</span> and <span class="hl">Favourites</span>.</p>
            <p>Click any item on a shelf to see your reflections on it. You can also move items between shelves using the <strong>Move</strong> button, or mark them as done.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="help-section" id="search">
          <div class="help-section-header">
            <div class="help-section-icon">🔍</div>
            <h2 class="help-section-title">Finding and saving media</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="help-body">
            <p>Use the <span class="hl">search bar</span> in the top navigation to find anything — a book, a film, a track. Switch between <strong>Books</strong>, <strong>Music</strong> and <strong>Movies</strong> using the tabs on the results page.</p>
            <p>When you find something, click <strong>Save to shelf</strong> and pick where it goes. It will appear in the matching room straight away.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="help-section" id="ai">
          <div class="help-section-header">
            <div class="help-section-icon">✨</div>
            <h2 class="help-section-title">AI Recommendations</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="help-body">
            <p>Scriptorium analyses your <span class="hl">Favourites</span> shelf across all three rooms to generate personalised recommendations just for you.</p>
            <p>The more you add to Favourites, the sharper the suggestions get. Head to <span class="hl">AI Recommendations</span> in the navbar to see what's been picked for you.</p>
            <p><strong>Tip:</strong> items you mark as Favourites carry the most weight — so if a recommendation misses the mark, check whether your favourites truly reflect your taste.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="help-section" id="reflections">
          <div class="help-section-header">
            <div class="help-section-icon">✍️</div>
            <h2 class="help-section-title">Reflections</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="help-body">
            <p>A reflection is a short note you write about a piece of media. Go to <span class="hl">Reflections</span> from the navbar (the pencil icon), pick an item from your shelves using the dropdown, choose your mood, and write. Minimum 30 characters.</p>
            <p>Not sure where to start? Hit <strong>Templates</strong> for guided prompts — things like First Impressions, Emotional Journey, or Would I Recommend.</p>
            <p>The <strong>History panel</strong> on the right shows your recent reflections. Click any card to read it in full, or hit <strong>View Full History</strong> to see everything.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="help-section" id="goals">
          <div class="help-section-header">
            <div class="help-section-icon">🎯</div>
            <h2 class="help-section-title">Goals & Progress</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="help-body">
            <p>Set a goal tied to a piece of media — for example, finishing a book or watching a series. Head to the <span class="hl">Progress</span> page from the navbar.</p>
            <p>Drag the <strong>progress bar</strong> left or right to update how far you've gotten. When you hit 100%, the goal is marked complete and you earn a completion bonus.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="help-section" id="streaks">
          <div class="help-section-header">
            <div class="help-section-icon">🔥</div>
            <h2 class="help-section-title">Daily streaks</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="help-body">
            <p>Write a reflection <strong>or</strong> update a goal once a day to keep your streak alive. The longer your streak, the more badges you unlock. Check your streak on the <span class="hl">Rewards</span> page.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="help-section" id="yarns">
          <div class="help-section-header">
            <div class="help-section-icon">🧶</div>
            <h2 class="help-section-title">Yarns & Rewards</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="help-body">
            <p>Every action earns you <span class="hl-gold">yarns</span> — the in-app currency. Check your balance and badge collection on the <span class="hl">Rewards</span> page.</p>
          </div>
          <table class="yarn-table">
            <tr><td>Writing a reflection</td><td>+10 🧶</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Updating goal progress</td><td>+5 🧶</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Completing a goal</td><td>+25 🧶</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Hitting a 7-day streak</td><td>+15 🧶</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Earning a badge</td><td>+20 🧶</td></tr>
          </table>
        </div>

        <div class="help-section" id="customise">
          <div class="help-section-header">
            <div class="help-section-icon">🐧</div>
            <h2 class="help-section-title">Customise</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="help-body">
            <p>Spend your yarns in the <span class="hl">Customise</span> page to unlock new animal avatars for your profile. Your avatar shows in the navigation bar and on your rewards screen. Rarer avatars cost more — start with the basics and work your way up.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div><!-- end help-content -->
    </div><!-- end help-layout -->
  </main>

  <script>
    // Highlight active sidebar link on scroll
    const sections = document.querySelectorAll('.help-section[id]');
    const navLinks = document.querySelectorAll('.help-nav-link');
    const observer = new IntersectionObserver(entries => {
      entries.forEach(entry => {
        if (entry.isIntersecting) {
          navLinks.forEach(l => l.classList.remove('active'));
          const active = document.querySelector(`.help-nav-link[href="#${entry.target.id}"]`);
          if (active) active.classList.add('active');
        }
      });
    }, { rootMargin: '-20% 0px -70% 0px' });
    sections.forEach(s => observer.observe(s));
  </script>

</body>
</html>
